  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "This is the key idea of the optimal solution.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3280,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 98,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "We have already protected the BOOF original first row and first column state.",
      "start_ms": 3820,
      "end_ms": 9600,
      "start_frame": 115,
      "end_frame": 288,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "From this point, their job changes.",
      "start_ms": 10280,
      "end_ms": 12940,
      "start_frame": 308,
      "end_frame": 388,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "The first column becomes row marker memory.",
      "start_ms": 13400,
      "end_ms": 15860,
      "start_frame": 402,
      "end_frame": 476,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "The first row becomes column marker memory.",
      "start_ms": 16320,
      "end_ms": 18800,
      "start_frame": 490,
      "end_frame": 564,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Now scan only the interior.",
      "start_ms": 19320,
      "end_ms": 21180,
      "start_frame": 580,
      "end_frame": 635,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppose we find an interior zero at row R column C.",
      "start_ms": 22020,
      "end_ms": 26160,
      "start_frame": 661,
      "end_frame": 785,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "We do not zero the complete row immediately.",
      "start_ms": 26520,
      "end_ms": 29660,
      "start_frame": 796,
      "end_frame": 890,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "We send information outward.",
      "start_ms": 30380,
      "end_ms": 31980,
      "start_frame": 911,
      "end_frame": 959,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Write zero at the first cell of that row.",
      "start_ms": 32780,
      "end_ms": 35020,
      "start_frame": 983,
      "end_frame": 1051,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "That means this row must become zero later.",
      "start_ms": 35500,
      "end_ms": 38800,
      "start_frame": 1065,
      "end_frame": 1164,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Then write zero at the top cell of that column.",
      "start_ms": 39180,
      "end_ms": 42180,
      "start_frame": 1175,
      "end_frame": 1265,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "That means this column must become zero later.",
      "start_ms": 42720,
      "end_ms": 46800,
      "start_frame": 1282,
      "end_frame": 1404,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "So an interior zero projects its information to the boundary.",
      "start_ms": 47660,
      "end_ms": 51340,
      "start_frame": 1430,
      "end_frame": 1540,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "After the discovery pass, the boundary contains everything we need.",
      "start_ms": 52220,
      "end_ms": 56880,
      "start_frame": 1567,
      "end_frame": 1706,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Then the direction reverses.",
      "start_ms": 56880,
      "end_ms": 59440,
      "start_frame": 1706,
      "end_frame": 1783,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Each interior cell asks two questions.",
      "start_ms": 59680,
      "end_ms": 62440,
      "start_frame": 1790,
      "end_frame": 1873,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Is my row marker zero?",
      "start_ms": 62900,
      "end_ms": 65180,
      "start_frame": 1887,
      "end_frame": 1955,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Or is my column marker zero?",
      "start_ms": 65980,
      "end_ms": 68500,
      "start_frame": 1979,
      "end_frame": 2055,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "If either answer is yes, the cell becomes zero.",
      "start_ms": 69000,
      "end_ms": 72460,
      "start_frame": 2070,
      "end_frame": 2174,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the interior is finished, the boundary has completed its marker job.",
      "start_ms": 73140,
      "end_ms": 77760,
      "start_frame": 2194,
      "end_frame": 2333,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we use the two saved Booleans to finalize the first row and the first column.",
      "start_ms": 78520,
      "end_ms": 85460,
      "start_frame": 2356,
      "end_frame": 2564,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "So the information flow is save the boundary history.",
      "start_ms": 86120,
      "end_ms": 90460,
      "start_frame": 2584,
      "end_frame": 2714,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Send zero information out to the boundary.",
      "start_ms": 91500,
      "end_ms": 94080,
      "start_frame": 2745,
      "end_frame": 2822,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the boundary to update the interior.",
      "start_ms": 94880,
      "end_ms": 97620,
      "start_frame": 2846,
      "end_frame": 2929,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Then finalize the boundary using the saved flags.",
      "start_ms": 98800,
      "end_ms": 103080,
      "start_frame": 2964,
      "end_frame": 3092,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let's execute that on our master matrix.",
      "start_ms": 103880,
      "end_ms": 106960,
      "start_frame": 3116,
      "end_frame": 3209,
      "word_count": 8
    }
  ],
